      "system": {
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong>: The Forgefiend hits with a bite attack.</p>\n<p>When the Forgefiend chews the target's armor, tearing and munching it into scraps. The target makes a <strong>Basic Saving Throw</strong> <span data-pf2-check=\"reflex\" data-pf2-traits=\"damaging-effect\" data-pf2-label=\"Rend Armor DC\" data-pf2-dc=\"26\" data-pf2-show-dc=\"gm\">Reflex</span>, on a failure the target's armor becomes broken. On a critical failure, the armor is so broken that the status penalty from broken armor is doubled: -2 for light armor, -4 for medium armor, and -6 for heavy armor.</p>"
        },
        "source": {
          "value": ""
        },
